/src/main/**/generated
/src/main/jniLibs/**/*.so
/src/main/assets/tauri.conf.json
/tauri.build.gradle.kts
/proguard-tauri.pro
/tauri.properties

# Added to what `tauri android init` wrote, because the build leaves more here than the template knew about: every file
# `bundle.resources` names is copied into `assets/` on the way to the APK, which is this repository's own `LICENSE` and
# `NOTICE`. The line above already names the one asset Tauri knew it would write; this one covers the rest of the
# directory, so nothing under it is committed and the full verification gate has no untracked file to refuse.
/src/main/assets/
